{"v":1,"ch":"control","type":"page","d":6,"content":"c5","page":0,"pages":1,"rows":[{"text":"It is written in the Book of Amaterasu Omikami:","style":0},{"text":"","style":0},{"text":"    After the Creation, the cruel god Moloch rebelled","style":0},{"text":"    against the authority of Marduk the Creator.","style":0},{"text":"    Moloch stole from Marduk the most powerful of all","style":0},{"text":"    the artifacts of the gods, the Amulet of Yendor,","style":0},{"text":"    and he hid it in the dark cavities of Gehennom, the","style":0},{"text":"    Under World, where he now lurks, and bides his time.","style":0},{"text":"","style":0},{"text":"Your goddess Amaterasu Omikami seeks to possess the Amulet, and with it","style":0},{"text":"to gain deserved ascendance over the other gods.","style":0},{"text":"","style":0},{"text":"You, a newly trained Hatamoto, have been heralded","style":0},{"text":"from birth as the instrument of Amaterasu Omikami.  You are destined","style":0},{"text":"to recover the Amulet for your deity, or die in the","style":0},{"text":"attempt.  Your hour of destiny has come.  For the sake","style":0},{"text":"of us all:  Go bravely with Amaterasu Omikami!","style":0}]}
